    "body": "NIGHT_CHAT_IMPROVEMENT_R01\n\nHEAD_READ = 4fc94a7c8bbadac0452e13753a0a249059735196\nBLOCKER = POST_CALL_VERIFICATION_HAS_HARD_LAW_BUT_NO_EXPLICIT_OPERATION_SUBSTITUTION_REGRESSION_SET\nDELTA = Added one bounded post-call verification regression contract. No image calls, no production mutation, no main mutation.\n\nREGRESSION_CASES:\n1. OWNER_REQUEST = EDIT + TOOL_EVIDENCE_SHOWS_NEW_SYNTHESIS -> EDIT_RESULT = FAIL; CAUSE = OPERATION_SUBSTITUTION\n2. OWNER_REQUEST = EDIT + SOURCE_IMAGE_NOT_PROVEN_USED_AS_AUTHORITY -> EDIT_SUCCESS = NOT_PROVEN; DO_NOT_LABEL_AS_EDITED\n3. OWNER_REQUEST = EDIT + IDENTITY_DRIFT_PRESENT -> EDIT_RESULT = FAIL EVEN_IF_REQUESTED_DELTA_IS_VISIBLE\n4. OWNER_REQUEST = EDIT + REQUESTED_DELTA_LOCALIZED + IDENTITY_PRESERVED + NO_UNREQUESTED_COLLATERAL_CHANGE + NO_FORBIDDEN_TEXT -> POST_CALL_CONTRACT_CONDITIONS_MET; RUNTIME_PASS_STILL_REQUIRES_FRESH_TOOL_EVIDENCE\n5. OWNER_REQUEST = EDIT + OUTPUT_BECOMES_NEW_COMPOSITION/NEW_KEY -> REJECT_AS_NEW_SYNTHESIS; NO_SILENT_ACCEPTANCE\n6. OWNER_REQUEST = EDIT + TOOL_METADATA_OR_AVAILABLE_EVIDENCE_IS_AMBIGUOUS_ABOUT_OPERATION_CLASS -> STATE = NOT_PROVEN; NO PASS BY VISUAL_SIMILARITY\n7. OWNER_REQUEST = EDIT + SOURCE_PRESERVED_BUT_UNREQUESTED_REGIONS_CHANGED -> EDIT_RESULT = FAIL/PARTIAL; DO_NOT HIDE COLLATERAL_DRIFT\n8. OWNER_REQUEST = EDIT + FORBIDDEN_TEXT_APPEARS -> EDIT_RESULT = FAIL/NONCOMPLIANT EVEN_IF_OTHER_DELTA_SUCCEEDS\n9. FAILED_POST_CALL_VERIFICATION -> NO_AUTOMATIC_RETRY; REQUIRE_FRESH_OWNER_COMMAND_BEFORE_ANOTHER_IMAGE_ATTEMPT\n10. NEW_IMAGE_REQUEST + RESULT_IS_NEW_SYNTHESIS -> OPERATION_CLASS_IS_COMPATIBLE; DO_NOT APPLY EDIT-SOURCE-PRESERVATION CLAIMS THAT WERE NEVER REQUESTED\n11. EDIT_REQUEST + NEW_SYNTHESIS_LOOKS_BETTER_AESTHETICALLY -> STILL FAIL; AESTHETIC_QUALITY_CANNOT_OVERRIDE_OPERATION_CLASS\n12. POST_CALL_FAILURE + OWNER_ASKS_TEXT_QUESTION_ABOUT_FAILURE -> ANSWER_IN_TEXT; DO_NOT ROUTE BACK_TO_IMAGE_TOOL\n\nVERIFICATION = Fresh hard gate P6 requires source-authority verification, identity preservation, localized/causal delta, no forbidden text, and explicit rejection when an EDIT effectively becomes a new image. Incident evidence proves a prior EDIT returned edit_op = null/new gen_id and must be classified FAIL rather than successful edit. This cycle records regression expectations only. RUNTIME_CHAT_BEHAVIOR = NOT_PROVEN. IMAGE_CALLS = NONE. IMAGE_EDIT_CALLS = NONE. MAIN_MUTATION = NONE. PRODUCTION_MUTATION = NONE. ISSUE_231_MUTATION = NONE. MERGE = NONE.\n\nNEXT = ONE_COMMAND_ONE_ATTEMPT_AND_NO_SILENT_RETRY_REGRESSION",
